{"ticker":"CCJ","updated":"2026-10-30T22:39:02Z","profile":{"longName":"Cameco Corporation","shortName":"Cameco Corporation","sector":"Energy","industry":"Uranium","country":"Canada","website":"https://www.cameco.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":33496844288,"trailingPE":130.35594,"forwardPE":40.656456,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.640429,"pegRatio":1.92,"targetMeanPrice":125.899506,"targetHighPrice":172.47084,"targetLowPrice":84.7799,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.072,"earningsGrowth":-0.921,"grossMargins":0.35112998,"operatingMargins":0.09111,"profitMargins":0.102139995,"totalRevenue":3474621952,"beta":1.141,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":135.24,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":73.885,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.21},"summary":"Cameco Corporation provides uranium for the generation of electricity in the Americas, Europe, and Asia. It operates in three segments: Uranium, Fuel Services, and Westinghouse. The Uranium segment engages in the exploration for, mining, milling, purchase, and sale of uranium concentrate. Its Fuel Services segment is involved in the refining, conversion, and fabrication of uranium concentrate, as well as purchase and sale of conversion services. The Westinghouse segment operates as a nuclear reactor technology original equipment manufacturer and a provider of products and services to commercial utilities and government agencies. It also provides outage and maintenance, engineering support, instrumentation and controls equipment, and plant modification services, as well as components and parts to nuclear reactors. The company sells its uranium and fuel products and services to nuclear utilities. Cameco Corporation was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Saskatoon, Canada.","summary_zh":"Cameco Corporation 為美洲、歐洲和亞洲的發電提供鈾。它分為三個部門：鈾部門、燃料服務部門和西屋公司。鈾部門從事鈾精礦的勘探、開採、研磨、購買和銷售。其燃料服務部門涉及鈾精礦的精煉、轉化和製造，以及轉化服務的購買和銷售。西屋電氣部門作為核反應器技術原始設備製造商以及商業公用事業和政府機構的產品和服務提供者。它還提供停電和維護、工程支援、儀表和控制設備、工廠改造服務以及核反應器零件。該公司向核設施出售鈾和燃料產品及服務。 Cameco Corporation 成立於 1987 年，總部位於加拿大薩斯卡通。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"鈾","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":74.41,"h":75.69,"l":73.2,"c":75.42,"v":4950700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":76.0,"h":77.67,"l":75.42,"c":77.17,"v":3618300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":76.93,"h":77.96,"l":75.73,"c":76.31,"v":2194900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":77.03,"h":77.79,"l":74.63,"c":75.85,"v":2481200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":76.76,"h":77.47,"l":74.99,"c":77.24,"v":2469500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":77.96,"h":79.54,"l":77.01,"c":77.39,"v":3714600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":78.17,"h":81.58,"l":77.99,"c":79.47,"v":4657100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":79.4,"h":81.39,"l":78.69,"c":79.89,"v":3701200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":79.48,"h":79.75,"l":77.53,"c":78.11,"v":3651100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":78.48,"h":86.37,"l":78.22,"c":86.32,"v":10202900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":86.33,"h":86.33,"l":79.71,"c":80.23,"v":7893300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":81.85,"h":82.34,"l":80.31,"c":81.81,"v":3893600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":82.7,"h":83.3,"l":81.34,"c":82.61,"v":4374400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":83.0,"h":86.84,"l":82.4,"c":86.18,"v":7982600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":86.8,"h":87.15,"l":82.95,"c":86.31,"v":6029900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":86.71,"h":88.45,"l":85.13,"c":86.89,"v":4657400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":87.78,"h":89.13,"l":82.95,"c":83.09,"v":6363600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":80.4,"h":86.46,"l":79.3,"c":85.66,"v":6950700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":85.66,"h":88.0,"l":84.78,"c":85.58,"v":3414200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":87.23,"h":87.67,"l":83.93,"c":84.46,"v":3541900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":83.65,"h":84.6,"l":82.53,"c":83.86,"v":4494100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":83.09,"h":84.41,"l":82.39,"c":83.49,"v":3961500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":84.29,"h":85.76,"l":82.72,"c":84.2,"v":3300700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":84.6,"h":86.0,"l":83.53,"c":84.17,"v":3528500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":86.38,"h":88.65,"l":85.15,"c":85.31,"v":6015700},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":86.17,"h":89.03,"l":84.52,"c":86.45,"v":4003200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":87.17,"h":88.48